@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Cloudflare Agents runtime
+
+The Worker deployment owns Durable Object bindings for `SupportAgent`, `StepSupportAgent`, and `DelegatingSupportAgent`, and must include those classes in a SQLite `new_sqlite_classes` migration. Because the agents pass the bare `openai/gpt-5` model ID to the AI SDK, deployment must provide the default AI Gateway provider binding or credentials. Worker configuration, class exports, routes, migrations, secrets, and deployment remain deployment responsibilities; this repository contains no Worker deployment configuration that proves their names or current state.
